# home-front workflow

- Before planning or implementing, read `.agents/WORKFLOW.md` and the approved plan (`.plans/` or `../home-api/.plans/` when cross).
- Sibling API: `../home-api` (Django). Consume OpenAPI; do not invent transport shapes.
- Do not implement while a plan awaits approval. Front-only plans go in `.plans/`; cross plans live in `../home-api/.plans/`.
- Delegate frontend work to `angular-frontend` using `.agents/HANDOFF.md`. After integration, run `qa`.
- Do not push, merge, deploy, or force dependency upgrades unless the user explicitly authorizes it.
- Preserve dirty worktree changes. Never hide failures by deleting tests or weakening assertions.
- After a repeatable agent failure, follow `.agents/policies/continuous-improvement.md` (or a parent harness directive) and record it in the plan.
